NNAAMMEE
       ppmglobe - generate strips to glue onto a sphere


SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
       ppppmmgglloobbee [--bbaacckkggrroouunndd==_c_o_l_o_r_n_a_m_e] [--cclloosseeookk] _s_t_r_i_p_c_o_u_n_t [_f_i_l_e_n_a_m_e]

       Minimum  unique abbreviation of option is acceptable.  You may use dou‐
       ble hyphens instead of single hyphen to denote options.   You  may  use
